media/
# NOT static/ - unlike staticfiles/ (collectstatic's generated output,
# already excluded via .gitignore and never present at build time), this
# is the committed SOURCE dir (favicon.svg, admin/api overrides, CKEditor
# dist) that collectstatic itself reads from - excluding it here left the
# built manifest missing entries the app references directly at import
# time (crud/urls.py's favicon route), crash-looping the container.
.git/
.gitignore
*.md
